Ottilius is a large half-[[Bestiary/Visitors from Beyond#Orc|Orc]] with greenish-gray skin and a shiny, bald head. He's a representative of [[Org/Althane/Hellstrome|Hellstrome]] in [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/Junction/index|Junction]], and is generally jolly with newcomers and old-hands alike.
